# ArrowRight from a story headline in its article's <header>, nothing beside it, stays: it climbed into the pinned header's Search button (Axios).
pages/card-header-beside-pinned-bar.html
start:css=#second
key:ArrowRight
expect-not:css=#search
eval:(() => { if (document.activeElement.id !== 'second') throw new Error('focus left for ' + document.activeElement.id); return 'stayed'; })()
